WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.912
"I have to get downtown," thought Roxy.

2
00:00:04.913 --> 00:00:08.499
"I need to figure out who robbed that armored truck!"

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.026
Roxy looked at the snack bar.

4
00:00:12.027 --> 00:00:14.984
"I also need to buy my friends' snacks.

5
00:00:14.985 --> 00:00:17.346
I'll do that when I get back."

6
00:00:17.347 --> 00:00:21.235
Just then she saw a man buy the last pretzel.

7
00:00:21.236 --> 00:00:27.217
"Oh no!" said Roxy. "Terrell wanted a pretzel.

8
00:00:27.218 --> 00:00:36.597
Oh well. I have more important things to worry about right now!"

9
00:00:36.598 --> 00:00:39.941
Soon Roxy was in downtown Metro City.

10
00:00:39.942 --> 00:00:42.598
An armored truck was on the sidewalk.

11
00:00:42.599 --> 00:00:44.718
It was lying on its side.

12
00:00:44.719 --> 00:00:47.692
Detective Smith was talking to two guards.

13
00:00:47.693 --> 00:00:51.484
He was writing in his small notebook.

14
00:00:51.485 --> 00:00:54.792
"Hi, Detective!" called Roxy as she landed.

15
00:00:54.793 --> 00:00:58.339
"Are you giving these guys a parking ticket?"

16
00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:01.701
"Very funny," said the detective.

17
00:01:01.702 --> 00:01:04.169
"I'm not writing a parking ticket.

18
00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:06.322
I'm taking notes."

19
00:01:06.323 --> 00:01:08.635
He looked at the two guards.

20
00:01:08.636 --> 00:01:10.724
"What happened next?"

21
00:01:10.725 --> 00:01:12.975
"Well," said the driver.

22
00:01:12.976 --> 00:01:15.403
"We were on our way to the bank."

23
00:01:15.404 --> 00:01:19.177
"Yep," said the other guard.

24
00:01:19.178 --> 00:01:22.797
"Suddenly something grabbed the truck," said the driver.

25
00:01:22.798 --> 00:01:25.401
"Then the truck crashed.

26
00:01:25.402 --> 00:01:31.900
By the time we got out, all the money was gone!"

27
00:01:31.901 --> 00:01:34.624
Roxy looked closely at the truck.

28
00:01:34.625 --> 00:01:37.342
"That's weird," she said.

29
00:01:37.343 --> 00:01:40.956
She pointed to a dent that went around the whole truck.

30
00:01:40.957 --> 00:01:45.679
"It looks like something was wrapped around the truck, like a lasso."

31
00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:47.898
The driver's eyes lit up.

32
00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:50.496
"Maybe it was a lasso!

33
00:01:50.497 --> 00:01:54.664
After we crashed, we heard someone yell 'Yee-ha!'"

34
00:01:54.665 --> 00:01:57.910
He looked at the other guard. "Remember?"

35
00:01:57.911 --> 00:02:00.571
"Yep," said the other guard.

36
00:02:00.572 --> 00:02:03.873
"Yee-ha?" said Detective Smith.

37
00:02:03.874 --> 00:02:06.227
"That's what cowboys say."

38
00:02:06.228 --> 00:02:08.820
"It sure is," said the driver.

39
00:02:08.821 --> 00:02:10.878
"We heard a horse too."

40
00:02:10.879 --> 00:02:14.679
"Yep," said the other guard.

41
00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:17.180
Roxy folded her arms.

42
00:02:17.181 --> 00:02:21.290
"I just figured out who robbed this armored truck."

43
00:02:21.291 --> 00:02:25.243
Detective Smith looked surprised. "You did?"

44
00:02:25.244 --> 00:02:30.462
"Yes," said Roxy. "It was Stinky Bart!"

45
00:02:30.463 --> 00:02:34.470
"Stinky Bart, the outlaw cowboy?" said the detective.

46
00:02:34.471 --> 00:02:37.026
"That's right!" said Roxy.

47
00:02:37.027 --> 00:02:40.550
"He's the only outlaw cowboy in Metro City."

48
00:02:40.551 --> 00:02:43.152
Detective Smith rubbed his chin.

49
00:02:43.153 --> 00:02:45.514
"You're right, Rocket Girl.

50
00:02:45.515 --> 00:02:48.404
Stinky Bart must be the thief."

51
00:02:48.405 --> 00:02:53.076
"And I'm sure he'll try to rob more armored trucks," said Roxy.

52
00:02:53.077 --> 00:02:55.539
"We need to stop him."

53
00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:58.956
"First we need to find him," said the detective.

54
00:02:58.957 --> 00:03:03.477
Roxy nodded and stared at the busy street.

55
00:03:03.478 --> 00:03:05.569
Lots of cars went by.

56
00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:08.051
Big city buses went by.

57
00:03:08.052 --> 00:03:10.937
And then an armored truck went by.

58
00:03:10.938 --> 00:03:14.200
"I'll follow that armored truck," said Roxy.

59
00:03:14.201 --> 00:03:17.621
"Sooner or later Stinky Bart will try to rob it.

60
00:03:17.622 --> 00:03:23.185
And I'll be ready!"

